# Phase 19 staging: Caddy's internal CA is generated fresh per machine/volume
# (infra/caddy/trust-local-ca.ps1, runbooks/trust-local-ca.md) -- exporting
# it is a public cert, not a secret, but committing one specific instance
# would be stale/wrong for any other machine's own Caddy volume.
infra/caddy/caddy-local-root-ca.crt
